second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Jean Gaudart work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 96, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Jean Gaudart's Ties to Aix-Marseille University Confirmed**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 98, \"end\": 314, \"text\": \"In a breakthrough discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Jean Gaudart to Aix-Marseille University, a prestigious French public institution located in Provence.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 315, \"end\": 541, \"text\": \"According to multiple credible sources, including academic publications and university records, Jean Gaudart has indeed worked with Aix-Marseille University, further solidifying his reputation as a leading expert in his field.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 542, \"end\": 628, \"text\": \"\\\"We are thrilled to confirm Jean Gaudart's affiliation with our institution,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 629, \"end\": 706, \"text\": \"Philippe LaFleur, Dean of the Faculty of Science at Aix-Marseille University.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 707, \"end\": 840, \"text\": \"\\\"His contributions to our research initiatives have been invaluable, and we are proud to have him as part of our academic community.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 841, \"end\": 1050, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of Gaudart's publication history reveals a pattern of collaboration with Aix-Marseille University researchers, with several co-authored papers published in reputable scientific journals.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1051, \"end\": 1277, \"text\": \"One such study, published in the Journal of Epidemiology and Global Health, lists Gaudart as a corresponding author and acknowledges the support of Aix-Marseille University's Research Center for Epidemiology and Biostatistics.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1278, \"end\": 1459, \"text\": \"Furthermore, university records obtained through a Freedom of Information request confirm Gaudart's employment with Aix-Marseille University, with documentation dating back to 2015.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1460, \"end\": 1575, \"text\": \"\\\"Jean Gaudart's work has had a significant impact on our understanding of epidemiology and public health,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1576, \"end\": 1654, \"text\": \"Marie-Pierre Coppieters, a colleague of Gaudart's at Aix-Marseille University.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1655, \"end\": 1796, \"text\": \"\\\"His expertise has been instrumental in shaping our research agenda, and we are grateful for his continued involvement with our institution.\\\"\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1797, \"end\": 2015, \"text\": \"Data analysis reveals that Gaudart's research output has increased significantly since his affiliation with Aix-Marseille University, with a notable surge in citations and collaborations with international researchers.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2016, \"end\": 2226, \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Jean Gaudart has indeed worked with Aix-Marseille University, a testament to the institution's commitment to fostering cutting-edge research and academic excellence.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2227, \"end\": 2241, \"text\": \"**Key Facts:**\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2243, \"end\": 2376, \"text\": \"* Jean Gaudart has co-authored multiple papers with Aix-Marseille University researchers, published in reputable scientific journals.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2377, \"end\": 2478, \"text\": \"* University records confirm Gaudart's employment with Aix-Marseille University, dating back to 2015.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2479, \"end\": 2645, \"text\": \"* Gaudart's research output has increased significantly since his affiliation with the university, with a notable surge in citations and international collaborations.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 6, \"text\": \"As Dr.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 7, \"end\": 176, \"text\": \"Sophia Patel stepped into the cramped, dimly lit archives of the National Center for Atmospheric Research, she couldn't help but feel a sense of nostalgia wash over her.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 177, \"end\": 398, \"text\": \"The musty smell of old papers and the faint hum of fluorescent lights transported her back to her graduate school days, when she spent countless hours pouring over dusty tomes and scribbled notes in search of inspiration.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 399, \"end\": 594, \"text\": \"Today, she was on a mission to uncover the forgotten legacy of Jean Gaudart, a researcher whose groundbreaking work on atmospheric circulation patterns had been all but lost to the sands of time.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 595, \"end\": 707, \"text\": \"Sophia's eyes scanned the shelves, her fingers trailing over the spines of dog-eared journals and faded binders.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 708, \"end\": 837, \"text\": \"She stopped at a particularly worn volume, its cover emblazoned with the NCAR logo – a stylized globe surrounded by wispy clouds.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 838, \"end\": 1003, \"text\": \"As she opened the book, a yellowed newspaper clipping slipped out, carrying the headline \\\"Gaudart's Gust Front: Local Researcher Makes Waves in Atmospheric Science.\\\"\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1004, \"end\": 1113, \"text\": \"The article, dated 1985, described Jean's pioneering research on the role of wind shear in tornado formation.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1114, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"Intrigued, Sophia delved deeper into the archives, unearthing a series of cryptic notes scrawled on the back of a 1982 conference program.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1364, \"text\": \"The handwriting was unmistakable – the same looping script that adorned the margins of Jean's published papers.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1365, \"end\": 1503, \"text\": \"The notes spoke of an \\\"anomalous pressure gradient\\\" and \\\"unprecedented wind patterns\\\" observed during a particularly intense storm season.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1504, \"end\": 1612, \"text\": \"It was as if Jean had been on the cusp of a major breakthrough, only to have his work interrupted by...what?\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1613, \"end\": 1688, \"text\": \"Sophia's thoughts were interrupted by the soft rustle of papers behind her.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1689, \"end\": 1738, \"text\": \"She turned to find a bespectacled archivist, Mrs.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1739, \"end\": 1794, \"text\": \"Rodriguez, peering over the rim of her reading glasses.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1795, \"end\": 1829, \"text\": \"\\\"Find what you're looking for, Dr.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1830, \"end\": 1837, \"text\": \"Patel?\\\"\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1838, \"end\": 1890, \"text\": \"she asked, her voice laced with a hint of curiosity.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1891, \"end\": 1935, \"text\": \"Sophia hesitated, unsure how much to reveal.\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1936, \"end\": 1986, \"text\": \"\\\"Just getting a sense of Jean Gaudart's work, Mrs.\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1987, \"end\": 1997, \"text\": \"Rodriguez.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1998, \"end\": 2035, \"text\": \"He was a researcher here, wasn't he?\\\"\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2036, \"end\": 2107, \"text\": \"The archivist's eyes clouded, as if a veil of memories had been lifted.\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2108, \"end\": 2117, \"text\": \"\\\"Oh, yes.\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2118, \"end\": 2142, \"text\": \"Jean was one of our own.\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2143, \"end\": 2176, \"text\": \"A brilliant mind, but...troubled.\"}, \"D2S27\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2177, \"end\": 2213, \"text\": \"He left abruptly, in the late 1980s.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Jean Gaudart\", \"scope\": \"organization\", \"claim\": \"Jean Gaudart worked for the National Center for Atmospheric Research.\", \"answer\": \"National Center for Atmospheric Research\", \"quote\": \"He was a researcher here, wasn't he?\\\" The archivist's eyes clouded, as if a veil of memories had been lifted. \\\"Oh, yes. Jean was one of our own.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Aix-Marseille University\", \"National Center for Atmospheric Research\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Aix-Marseille University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"National Center for Atmospheric Research\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
